{"id":10237,"name":"lilligant-hisui","speciesId":549,"dex":549,"form":"hisuian","generation":5,"types":["grass","fighting"],"stats":{"hp":70,"attack":105,"defense":75,"special-attack":50,"special-defense":75,"speed":105},"abilities":[{"name":"chlorophyll","hidden":false},{"name":"hustle","hidden":false},{"name":"leaf-guard","hidden":true}],"height":12,"weight":192,"baseExp":168,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10237.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10237.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10237.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10237.ogg","genus":"Flowering Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon florescendo","flavor":[{"version":"black","text":"Even veteran Trainers face a challenge in getting its beautiful flower to bloom. This Pokémon is popular with celebrities."},{"version":"white","text":"The fragrance of the garland on its head has a relaxing effect. It withers if a Trainer does not take good care of it."},{"version":"black-2","text":"The fragrance of the garland on its head has a relaxing effect, but taking care of it is very difficult."},{"version":"sun","text":"No matter how much time and money is spent raising it, its flowers are the most beautiful when they bloom in the wild."},{"version":"moon","text":"As soon as it finds a male to be its partner, the beautiful flower on its head darkens, droops, and withers away."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"The fragrance of its flower differs slightly depending on the soil where it grew up. Sniffing the aroma calms your heart and mind."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It’s well liked by other Pokémon because of its beauty. The flower on its head needs constant care, or it will soon wither and rot."},{"version":"sword","text":"It’s believed that even first-rate gardeners have a hard time getting the flower on a Lilligant’s head to bloom."},{"version":"shield","text":"Essential oils made from Lilligant flowers have a sublime scent, but they’re also staggeringly expensive."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"I suspect that its well-developed legs are the result of a life spent on mountains covered in deep snow. The scent it exudes from its flower crown heartens those in proximity."}],"flavorPt":"Suspeito que suas pernas bem desenvolvidas sejam o resultado de uma vida passada em montanhas cobertas de neve profunda. O perfume que exala de sua coroa de flores anima aqueles que estão próximos.","genderRate":8,"captureRate":75,"eggGroups":["plant"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"petilil","speciesId":548,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Usar Sun Stone","Usar Sun Stone"],"species":"lilligant","speciesId":549,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":549,"name":"lilligant","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/549.png"},{"id":10237,"name":"lilligant-hisui","form":"hisuian","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10237.png"}],"games":[24,25],"moves":[{"id":14,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":25,"learn":[[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":36,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":63,"learn":[[24,"tutor",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":67,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":71,"learn":[[24,"lv",1],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":72,"learn":[[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":73,"learn":[[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":74,"learn":[[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":76,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":77,"learn":[[24,"lv",15]]},{"id":78,"learn":[[24,"lv",9],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":79,"learn":[[24,"lv",29],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":80,"learn":[[24,"lv",53]]},{"id":105,"learn":[[24,"lv",37]]},{"id":116,"learn":[[24,"tutor",0]]},{"id":118,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":156,"learn":[[24,"tutor",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":164,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":182,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id